摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Cross-session memory plugin for DSH — auto-extraction, semantic recall, scheduled maintenance, LLM-powered consolidation","id":"gh:1339263264","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-memory-connect","slug":"Asher-2000/dsh-memory-connect","topics":["ai-agent","cross-session","dsh","dsh-plugin","llm","memory"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Cross-session memory plugin for DSH — auto-extraction, semantic recall, scheduled maintenance, LLM-p"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"owered consolidation"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# @asherliner/dsh-memory-connect"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"> 跨会话记忆插件 — 让 AI Agent 拥有持久记忆和全局身份\n> Cross-session memory plugin for DeepSeek Harness (DSH)"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"**English** | 中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"## Overview"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"`dsh-memory-connect` is a cross-session memory sharing plugin for DeepSeek Harness. It automatically"},{"id":"p6s2","text":" extracts, stores, and recalls memories across sessions, giving your AI agent persistent, intelligen"},{"id":"p6s3","text":"t memory with **context explosion prevention** and **global Soul identity**."},{"id":"p7s1","text":"**Zero-config** — works out of the box with SQLite FTS5 and DSH's built-in LLM."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"> ### 🚨 v0.4.0 — The \"it actually works now\" release\n>\n> v0.3.0 registered the service but **never i"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"nstantiated it** (Cordis lazily constructs services — passing the class to `ctx.provide()` means the"},{"id":"p8s3","text":" constructor never runs), and the \"recall\" feature wrote a computed context to a field **no one ever"},{"id":"p8s4","text":" read**. In practice the plugin did nothing.\n>\n> v0.4.0 fixes the activation chain and **wires recal"},{"id":"p8s5","text":"l into the system prompt**: a `systemPrompt.context` provider injects `## Related Memories from Prev"},{"id":"p8s6","text":"ious Sessions` on every turn. **Zero-config runnable**: a bare `dsh plugin add` used to crash on `co"},{"id":"p8s7","text":"nfig.openAt` (Cordis passes `undefined` config when the patch has no `config:` block) — `apply()` no"},{"id":"p8s8","text":"w fills in full defaults (DB at `~/.dsh/memory.db`, `openAt: startup`). Verified end-to-end on dsh v"},{"id":"p8s9","text":"0.1.1-rc.2 / Node 24: tell session A \"my cat is named Mimi\", start a fresh session B and ask — the m"},{"id":"p8s10","text":"odel answers correctly from memory.\n>\n> See CHANGELOG.md for the full breakdown."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Features"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Feature | Description |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| 🧠 **Global Soul** | Persistent identity across all workspaces via ~/.dsh/soul.md |\n| 🔍 **Auto Extr"},{"id":"p11s2","text":"action** | Extracts facts, preferences, decisions, and context from conversations |\n| 🧠 **Cross-Sess"},{"id":"p11s3","text":"ion Recall** | FTS5 keyword recall injected into the system prompt **every turn** (recency fallback "},{"id":"p11s4","text":"when no query text is available) |\n| 🛡️ **Context Explosion Prevention** | Token budget management p"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"revents context window overflow |\n| ⏰ **Scheduled Maintenance** | Automatic periodic decay and conso"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"lidation via built-in scheduler |\n| 🤖 **LLM Consolidation** | Intelligent memory merging using DSH's"},{"id":"p11s7","text":" built-in `ctx.llm` (zero-config) |\n| 📉 **Memory Decay** | Old, unused memories naturally fade; freq"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"uently accessed ones persist |\n| 🎯 **Smart Prioritization** | Memory selection based on relevance × "},{"id":"p11s9","text":"recency × frequency |\n| 🗜️ **Memory Compression** | Automatic compression when approaching token lim"},{"id":"p11s10","text":"its |\n| 🧭 **Temporal Context Graph** | Every memory carries `valid_from`/`valid_until`; corrections "},{"id":"p11s11","text":"are **append-only** via `reviseMemory()` (soft-supersede + successor link), never destructive. Histo"},{"id":"p11s12","text":"ry stays queryable; recall only sees current truth. |\n| 🛡️ **Trust Model** | Recalled history is inj"},{"id":"p11s13","text":"ected as an **untrusted reference** (explicit warning; current instruction always wins) — prevents m"},{"id":"p11s14","text":"emory poisoning and prompt conflicts |\n| 📝 **Turn-End Summarization** | `turn/end` events auto-gener"},{"id":"p11s15","text":"ate lightweight `summary` memories preserving the conversation arc |\n| 🔎 **Semantic Recall** | Optio"},{"id":"p11s16","text":"nal local embedding (BGE-small-zh-v1.5) fuses with FTS5 via RRF — finds memories *by meaning* even w"},{"id":"p11s17","text":"ith zero keyword overlap. Opt-in (`embeddingEnabled: true`). |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"## 🧠 Global Soul (Identity)"},{"id":"p13s1","text":"The Soul feature provides a **persistent identity** that follows you across all workspaces."},{"id":"p14s1","text":"### How it works"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"1. Create `~/.dsh/soul.md` with your identity information\n2. The plugin automatically loads and inje"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"cts it into every session\n3. Your preferences, tech stack, and coding style are always available"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"### Example Soul file"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"## Installation"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"> ✅ **Published on npm** — install from npm registry (v0.6.1):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"Add to your DSH composition:"},{"id":"p22s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"> **Requirement**: the plugin injects `systemPrompt` (used for the cross-session recall context prov"},{"id":"p23s2","text":"ider). Any profile that loads this plugin needs the `systemPrompt` service available (standard in th"},{"id":"p23s3","text":"e dsh web/headless profiles)."},{"id":"p24s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p25s1","text":"### Basic Options"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"| Option | Default | Description |"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"| `path` | *(required)* | Path to SQLite memory database |\n| `openAt` | `startup` | When to open: `s"},{"id":"p27s2","text":"tartup`, `first-query`, `never` |\n| `maxRecallCount` | `10` | Max memories to recall per session |\n|"},{"id":"p27s3","text":" `decayRate` | `0.02` | Decay constant (higher = faster decay) |\n| `journalMode` | `wal` | SQLite jo"},{"id":"p27s4","text":" | `0.02` | Decay constant (higher = faster decay) |\n| `journalMode` | `wal` | SQLite journal mode |"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"### How It Works"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"1. **Token Counting** — Estimates tokens for English, Chinese, and mixed text\n2. **Smart Prioritizat"},{"id":"p29s2","text":"ion** — Ranks memories by: `relevance × 50% + recency × 30% + frequency × 20%`\n3. **Budget Managemen"},{"id":"p29s3","text":"t** — Enforces `maxContextTokens` limit (default: 4000)\n4. **Memory Compression** — Automatically tr"},{"id":"p29s4","text":"uncates or summarizes when approaching limits"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"## 核心功能"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| 功能 | 说明 |"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"| 🧠 **全局身份 (Soul)** | 通过 ~/.dsh/soul.md 跨所有工作区持久化身份 |\n| 🔍 **自动提取** | 从对话中提取事实、偏好、决策和上下文 |\n| 🧠 **跨会话召"},{"id":"p32s2","text":"回** | FTS5 关键词召回，**每轮**注入系统提示词（无查询文本时按最近记忆兜底） |\n| 🛡️ **上下文爆炸防护** | Token 预算管理，防止上下文窗口溢出 |\n| ⏰ **定时维护"},{"id":"p32s3","text":"** | 内置调度器自动执行衰减和整合 |\n| 🤖 **LLM 整合** | 使用 DSH 内置 LLM 智能合并相似记忆 |\n| 📉 **记忆衰减** | 旧的、不常用的记忆自然消退 |\n| 🎯 *"},{"id":"p32s4","text":"*智能优先级** | 基于相关性 × 时间 × 频率的记忆排序 |\n| 🗜️ **记忆压缩** | 接近 token 限制时自动压缩 |\n| 🧭 **时态上下文图谱** | 每条记忆带 `valid_"},{"id":"p32s5","text":"from`/`valid_until`；修正通过 `reviseMemory()` **追加而非覆盖**（软废弃旧记忆 + 新记忆链接），历史可回溯，召回只见当前有效真相 |\n| 🛡️ **信任模型*"},{"id":"p32s6","text":"* | 召回的历史作为**不可信参考**注入（显式警告；当前指令绝对优先）— 防止记忆投毒和提示词冲突 |\n| 📝 **轮末自动摘要** | `turn/end` 事件自动生成轻量 `summary`"},{"id":"p32s7","text":"*不可信参考**注入（显式警告；当前指令绝对优先）— 防止记忆投毒和提示词冲突 |\n| 📝 **轮末自动摘要** | `turn/end` 事件自动生成轻量 `summary` 记忆，保留对话脉络 |"}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
